{"3778650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wall Brawl", "steam_appid": 3778650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall Brawl is a multiplayer battleground where teams claim resources, build strongholds, and break through rival fortifications in a battle for the realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct towering castles, siege enemy bases, and fight through fallen fortresses as battles reshape the field.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build-up, Fight and Grow Stronger</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/7a022d209e5d3e877f70de80ad67f621.poster.avif?t=1781582685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/7a022d209e5d3e877f70de80ad67f621.webm?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/7a022d209e5d3e877f70de80ad67f621.mp4?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into chaotic skirmishes where every moment counts. Build up a base and defenses, lay claim to resources, discover powerful items, unlock new talents, and push into enemy territory. Each match unfolds differently as teams clash, regroup, and adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Rival Teams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/748dd00567d0a04d812b2fbc96ce99c9.poster.avif?t=1781582685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/748dd00567d0a04d812b2fbc96ce99c9.webm?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/748dd00567d0a04d812b2fbc96ce99c9.mp4?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in melee, ranged, and magic combat with abilities that knock enemies off their feet, blast them through walls, and open up creative plays. Combat stays readable and impactful, creating clear moments to strike, defend, and reposition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construct and Collapse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/a8a073e181a16e9677a3ac2ff8ec2ea5.poster.avif?t=1781582685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/a8a073e181a16e9677a3ac2ff8ec2ea5.webm?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/a8a073e181a16e9677a3ac2ff8ec2ea5.mp4?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build stone walls, towers, and layered defenses that stand firm against most attacks. Fortified strongholds become last‑stand holdouts as enemy teams crash against the walls in full‑force sieges. Only committed siege efforts can break them—knocking out sections and triggering dynamic, <strong>physics‑driven</strong> destruction that opens new angles, chokepoints, and ambush routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Form teams</strong> of 1-4 before entering battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Build and destroy massive fortresses</strong> as teams clash across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Lay claim and fight for control of resources </strong>to grow stronger and outpace rival teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Breach enemy bases and launch raids</strong> to steal momentum and swing the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Discover items and upgrades</strong> that shape your role and create wild, unexpected plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Choose between melee, ranged, and magic archetypes</strong> to fit your style and your team’s needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Directional, proximity‑based voice chat</strong> brings player interactions to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Win by holding the central flag or becoming the last team standing</strong> in up to 32‑player battles.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall Brawl is a multiplayer battleground where teams claim resources, build strongholds, and break through rival fortifications in a battle for the realm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct towering castles, siege enemy bases, and fight through fallen fortresses as battles reshape the field.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build-up, Fight and Grow Stronger</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/7a022d209e5d3e877f70de80ad67f621.poster.avif?t=1781582685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/7a022d209e5d3e877f70de80ad67f621.webm?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/7a022d209e5d3e877f70de80ad67f621.mp4?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into chaotic skirmishes where every moment counts. Build up a base and defenses, lay claim to resources, discover powerful items, unlock new talents, and push into enemy territory. Each match unfolds differently as teams clash, regroup, and adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Rival Teams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/748dd00567d0a04d812b2fbc96ce99c9.poster.avif?t=1781582685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/748dd00567d0a04d812b2fbc96ce99c9.webm?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/748dd00567d0a04d812b2fbc96ce99c9.mp4?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in melee, ranged, and magic combat with abilities that knock enemies off their feet, blast them through walls, and open up creative plays. Combat stays readable and impactful, creating clear moments to strike, defend, and reposition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construct and Collapse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/a8a073e181a16e9677a3ac2ff8ec2ea5.poster.avif?t=1781582685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/a8a073e181a16e9677a3ac2ff8ec2ea5.webm?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/extras/a8a073e181a16e9677a3ac2ff8ec2ea5.mp4?t=1781582685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build stone walls, towers, and layered defenses that stand firm against most attacks. Fortified strongholds become last‑stand holdouts as enemy teams crash against the walls in full‑force sieges. Only committed siege efforts can break them—knocking out sections and triggering dynamic, <strong>physics‑driven</strong> destruction that opens new angles, chokepoints, and ambush routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Form teams</strong> of 1-4 before entering battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Build and destroy massive fortresses</strong> as teams clash across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Lay claim and fight for control of resources </strong>to grow stronger and outpace rival teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Breach enemy bases and launch raids</strong> to steal momentum and swing the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Discover items and upgrades</strong> that shape your role and create wild, unexpected plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Choose between melee, ranged, and magic archetypes</strong> to fit your style and your team’s needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Directional, proximity‑based voice chat</strong> brings player interactions to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Win by holding the central flag or becoming the last team standing</strong> in up to 32‑player battles.</p>", "short_description": "Hold the line! Team up in this tactical multiplayer castle‑brawler where players raise fortresses, set up defenses, and smash through enemy strongholds with physics‑driven destruction. Heroic last stands! Questionable tactics! Bricks moving at unsafe speeds!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/a501a4ee757e487ddbd876232291e79c895c6a1e/header.jpg?t=1781582685", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778650/48451ce806efc629ad89b0fedb39b49806ea2849/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781582685", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as